  "description": "Eun-Ha, who had set out on a journey, encounters a mysterious boy named San-Ho being chased by a stranger there. She barely manages to escape with San-Ho, but a month later, San-Ho dies right before Eun-Ha's eyes. Eun-Ha flees back to Korea, and 17 years later, a man resembling the deceased San-Ho appears before her. The man introduces himself as Shin Noel, but he overlaps with San-Ho in far too many ways. Could he really not be San-Ho? Or is he San-Ho? A story of searching for you even within distorted memories. Remember me.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
